    "description": "<p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Hazards\" title=\"Hazards\">Hazards</a></i> </p><p><i>This automated turret blasts enemies that come within its range.</i> </p><h2><span id=\"Blaster_Turret_Statistics_.28CL_2.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Blaster_Turret_Statistics_(CL_2)\">Blaster Turret Statistics (CL 2)</span></h2><p><b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Keywords\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Keywords\">Keywords</a>:</b> Artificial, Energy </p><p><b>Trigger:</b> The Blaster Turret detects a being within its line of sight. </p><p><b>Attack:</b> +4 vs <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a> </p><p><b>Recurrence:</b> Each round, on <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Initiative_Count\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Initiative Count\">Initiative Count</a> (<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Initiative\" title=\"Initiative\">Initiative</a> +5) </p><p><b>Suggested&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skills\" title=\"Skills\">Skills</a>:</b>&nbsp;The following are suggested&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skills\" title=\"Skills\">Skills</a>&nbsp;for this Hazard: </p><ul>\n <li><b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Stealth</a>:</b> The character makes a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Stealth</a> check, opposed by the turret's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> check (+5, with <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Darkvision\" title=\"Darkvision\">Darkvision</a>). If the character's check is successful, the character is not noticed by the Blaster Turret.</li>\n</ul>",
